# Nexus Mods BBCode Formatting &amp; Adjacency Test

Open this file in Markdown BBCode, click **Copy BBCode** (Nexus target), and paste the output into a Nexus Mods description field. Every block is labeled with an ID and description without square brackets (except task checkboxes and the literal-brackets test in Section 12) so spacing, collapsing, or broken tags stand out immediately.

