> [!info] S08F — Fixed Callout (multi-paragraph + list)
> First paragraph inside Callout.
> 
> Second paragraph inside Callout.
> 
> - List item inside Callout

#### S08G — H4 after Fixed Callout

S08H — Paragraph before Collapsible (-) Callout.

> [!warning]- S08I — Collapsible Callout (default collapsed)
> Hidden details inside collapsed Callout.

S08J — Paragraph after Collapsible (-) Callout.

> [!example]+ S08K — Collapsible (+) Callout before Fixed Callout
> Body inside expanded Callout.

> [!caution] S08L — Fixed Callout after Collapsible Callout and before Bullet list
> Body inside Fixed Callout.

- S08M — Bullet list after Callout
- Second bullet

> [!warning]- S08N — Outer Collapsible Callout containing nested Callout
> Outer paragraph before inner Callout.
> 
