## Section 12 — Inline Formatting, Nesting &amp; Parser Edge Cases

S12A — All standard inline marks: **bold**, *italic*, ~~strikethrough~~, <span style="color: #e6a050">warm amber</span>, [Nexus Mods](https://www.nexusmods.com/), [mailto link](mailto:test@example.com).

S12B — Mid-sentence `inline code` inside an isolated paragraph to test whether Nexus forces a line or block break.

S12C — Mid-sentence ||inline spoiler|| inside an isolated paragraph to test whether Nexus forces a toggle box break.

S12D — Multiple inline `code one` and `code two` alongside ||spoiler one|| and ||spoiler two|| on the same line.

S12E — Nested inline marks: ***bold italic***, **bold with *italic* and ~~strike~~**, <span style="color: #60a5fa">**colored bold** and *colored italic*</span>, [**bold link**](https://www.nexusmods.com/), [<span style="color: #05df72">colored link</span>](https://www.nexusmods.com/), and ||**bold** and <span style="color: #ffb900">colored</span> inside inline spoiler||.

### S12F — Heading with *italic*, ~~strike~~, <span style="color: #e6a050">color</span>, and [link](https://www.nexusmods.com/)

S12G — Escaping and literal characters: \|\|escaped pipes\|\|, literal brackets \[Mod Name\], \[Optional\], \[1\], and \[b\]fake bold\[/b\].

S12H — Punctuation &amp; Unicode: em-dash — arrow → ampersand &amp; comparisons a &lt; b and c &gt; d plus accents éàü.